{"text":"And I think that's an important point, but also remember that in Africa, you know, in the 1990s, had more civil unrest and civil war and civil failed states than the rest of the world put together. There's a reason for this. We're not developing the private sector as we would like to see it develop. Linked again to the aid culture is that there's money coming into the society, which means that governments don't need to tax their citizens. Look at the World Bank doing business around the World Survey. Consistently, African countries ranking at the bottom, causing a lot of problems, not creating entrepreneurship, not creating business flows. I could go on and on. I would just say, ignore everything I've said thus far. The biggest problem with the aid culture is that it disenfranchises Africans.","words":[{"text":"And","start":1.24,"end":1.72},{"text":"I","start":1.72,"end":2.2},{"text":"think","start":2.2,"end":2.32},{"text":"that's","start":2.32,"end":2.54},{"text":"an","start":2.54,"end":2.62},{"text":"important","start":2.62,"end":2.92},{"text":"point","start":2.92,"end":3.34,"punct":","},{"text":"but","start":3.52,"end":3.66},{"text":"also","start":3.66,"end":4.18},{"text":"remember","start":4.18,"end":5.64},{"text":"that","start":5.64,"end":6.08},{"text":"in","start":6.08,"end":6.74},{"text":"Africa","start":6.74,"end":7.18,"punct":","},{"text":"you","start":7.7,"end":7.82},{"text":"know","start":7.82,"end":7.96,"punct":","},{"text":"in","start":8.02,"end":8.1},{"text":"the","start":8.1,"end":8.18},{"text":"1990s","start":8.18,"end":9.14,"punct":","},{"text":"had","start":9.22,"end":9.3},{"text":"more","start":9.3,"end":9.72},{"text":"civil","start":9.72,"end":10.08},{"text":"unrest","start":10.08,"end":10.56},{"text":"and","start":10.56,"end":10.94},{"text":"civil","start":10.94,"end":11.24},{"text":"war","start":11.24,"end":11.62},{"text":"and","start":11.62,"end":11.9},{"text":"civil","start":11.9,"end":12.24},{"text":"failed","start":12.24,"end":12.8